  "title": "Beyond IEC 60601: Standards and Medical Device Safety by Design",
  "summary": "Medical diagnostic and surgical systems must follow some of the world’s strictest safety standards. The best known is the International Electrotechnical Commission (IEC) 60601, which ensures there is no risk to patients and/or operators, but there are others to consider when developing healthcare products for worldwide markets.",
